# Discoverable universes for the Open Universe start-screen "Universe" dropdown.
# Each label registers a universe (type: universe/<key>). The primary format names
# a single merged `universe:` AMD file (identity + clans + jobs + narrative in one
# place - see UNIVERSE_CHANGES.md capstone). Legacy labels may instead name split
# `clans:` / `narrative:` files; the loader falls back to those (universe_file).
# Add more universes by adding more labels here.

=== universe_default
metadata:``` yaml
type: universe/default
key: default
display: Default
universe: default.amd
```
    ->END
